<h1>OpenGyoza Documentation</h1>

<p>Welcome to the OpenGyoza documentation! The documentation is reference
material for all available features and options.</p>

<p>In the Quick Links below, you will find the most commonly used documentation
and a link to our guides that walk you through common tasks. Upstream Consul
guides are still useful, but use the OpenGyoza CLI name in examples.</p>

<p>New to OpenGyoza? Start with the <a href="/docs/guides/gyoza-migration.html">migration guide</a>.</p>

